<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Desktop only strings.

    The main translation set is generated from the Android resources, which the desktop build is
    not allowed to edit. These are the handful of labels the Windows app needs and Android has no
    equivalent for, kept here so both platforms stay untouched by each other.

    A bare element supplies the neutral English text. Elements carrying a locale attribute
    override it for that satellite; a missing locale falls back to English.
-->
